  "Research topic": "研究主题",
  "High spatial resolution hyperspectral imagery (HR-HSI) is essential for fine-scale ecological and environmental monitoring, yet current spaceborne sensors are constrained by a trade-off between spectral and spatial resolution. This study develops a deep learning fusion framework that reconstructs HR-HSI by integrating low-resolution hyperspectral imagery from NASA's EMIT with high-resolution multispectral imagery from PlanetScope. The model was evaluated across three ecologically distinct landscapes in the western United States using airborne AVIRIS-NG and AVIRIS-3 imagery as reference data. The proposed framework consistently outperformed seven peer state-of-the-art fusion models, achieving a best spectral angle mapper (SAM) of 2.64 and a root mean squared error (RMSE) of 0.0267. A sensor inter-calibration pipeline ensured radiometric consistency between EMIT and PlanetScope, improving the reliability of the fusion inputs.": "高空间分辨率高光谱影像（HR-HSI）对精细尺度生态与环境监测至关重要，但现有星载传感器受到光谱分辨率与空间分辨率之间权衡的限制。本研究开发了深度学习融合框架，将 NASA EMIT 的低空间分辨率高光谱影像与 PlanetScope 的高空间分辨率多光谱影像结合，重建 HR-HSI。以机载 AVIRIS-NG 和 AVIRIS-3 影像为参考，在美国西部三个生态特征不同的景观中评估模型。该框架持续优于七种先进融合模型，最佳光谱角（SAM）为2.64，均方根误差（RMSE）为0.0267。传感器交叉校准流程保证了 EMIT 与 PlanetScope 间的辐射一致性，提高了融合输入的可靠性。",
  "JCR 2025 · Remote Sensing": "JCR 2025 · 遥感",
  "JCR Q2 · Remote Sensing": "JCR Q2 · 遥感",
  "This study tested whether shoreline shape and displacement can identify erosion and accretion hotspots despite changing lake levels. Along 125 km of southwestern Lake Michigan shoreline, 2010 and 2020 aerial imagery was evaluated with Fréchet, modified Euclidean, and combined Union distances at 100 m, 500 m, and 1 km scales. The combined measure improved hotspot detection over uncalibrated transect-based comparisons at 500 m and 1 km. Performance depended on local shoreline conditions, and the 100 m scale remained sensitive to water-level effects. The framework offers calibration-free regional screening while retaining the need for water-level correction in detailed local assessments.": "本研究检验在湖泊水位变化的情况下，岸线形态和位移能否识别侵蚀与淤积热点。研究覆盖密歇根湖西南岸125公里岸线，使用2010年和2020年的航空影像，在100米、500米和1公里尺度上评估 Fréchet 距离、修正欧氏距离及二者结合的 Union 距离。与未经校准的断面比较相比，组合指标在500米和1公里尺度提高了热点识别能力。方法表现取决于局地岸线条件，100米尺度仍对水位影响敏感。该框架可用于无需校准的区域初筛，但精细的局地评估仍需水位校正。",
  "JCR 2025 · Geography, Physical": "JCR 2025 · 自然地理",
  "JCR Q2 · Geography, Physical": "JCR Q2 · 自然地理",
  "This study evaluates the inconsistency between deep learning-based waterbody segmentation and shoreline positioning using aerial imagery from the Great Lakes region. Despite strong pixel-level segmentation accuracy (>98% accuracy, >90% IoU) across five benchmark models tested on 20,689 NAIP images, shoreline positioning accuracy was substantially lower and varied significantly by landscape type—with poorest results in wetlands and urban areas. The shoreline-to-water ratio emerged as the dominant predictor of positioning accuracy, while shoreline complexity and water color showed weaker, context-dependent effects. These findings highlight the need for shoreline-specific evaluation metrics rather than relying solely on conventional segmentation benchmarks when applying deep learning to coastal and lake boundary detection tasks.": "本研究利用五大湖地区的航空影像，评估深度学习水体分割与岸线定位之间的不一致性。在20,689幅 NAIP 影像上测试的五种基准模型，虽取得较高的像素级分割精度（准确率大于98%，IoU 大于90%），但岸线定位精度明显较低，且随景观类型显著变化，湿地和城市区域表现最差。岸线—水体比是定位精度的主要预测因子，岸线复杂度和水色的影响较弱且依赖具体情境。结果表明，将深度学习用于海岸与湖泊边界检测时，需要专门的岸线评价指标，不能仅依赖常规分割指标。",
  "This study combined PRISMA imaging spectroscopy with NEON airborne observations to map seasonal changes in chlorophyll, carotenoids, equivalent water thickness, and nitrogen across 11 forest sites in the contiguous United States. PLSR models first produced 1 m NEON trait maps, which were aggregated to 30 m and used to train site-level models with PRISMA reflectance and PRISMA-derived leaf area index as predictors. Validation yielded R² of 0.78–0.88 and NRMSE of 5.4–8.4%. Chlorophyll and carotenoids followed bell-shaped seasonal patterns, water thickness generally declined, and nitrogen varied less strongly. The analysis also identified regional climatic controls on seasonality and soil-related controls on spatial variation.": "本研究结合 PRISMA 成像光谱与 NEON 机载观测，绘制美国本土11个森林站点的叶绿素、类胡萝卜素、等效水厚度和氮含量季节变化。首先利用 PLSR 模型生成1米 NEON 性状图，再聚合到30米，以 PRISMA 反射率及其反演的叶面积指数作为预测变量，训练站点尺度模型。验证结果为 R²=0.78—0.88，NRMSE=5.4—8.4%。叶绿素和类胡萝卜素呈钟形季节变化，水厚度总体下降，氮含量的变化较弱。研究还识别出季节变化的区域气候控制因素，以及空间差异的土壤控制因素。",
  "A hybrid neural network was pretrained with radiative transfer simulations and fine-tuned with measured leaf spectra to estimate chlorophyll, carotenoids, leaf mass per area, and equivalent water thickness. Tests using three datasets from the United States and Europe evaluated prediction across locations, plant functional types, and seasons. The framework improved accuracy and transferability relative to PLSR, Gaussian process regression, and radiative transfer model inversion. Incorporating leaf-optics knowledge before fine-tuning helped the model make effective use of limited observations in new environments.": "本研究先用辐射传输模拟预训练混合神经网络，再用实测叶片光谱微调，估算叶绿素、类胡萝卜素、单位面积叶片质量和等效水厚度。利用来自美国与欧洲的三个数据集，评估模型跨地点、植物功能型及季节的预测表现。与 PLSR、高斯过程回归和辐射传输模型反演相比，该框架提高了预测精度与可迁移性。在微调前引入叶片光学知识，使模型能够有效利用新环境中有限的实测数据。",
  "ESI Top 1% Highly Cited": "ESI 前1%高被引论文",
  "Using 47,393 leaf spectral records spanning more than 700 species, eight plant functional types, and 101 sites, this study tested whether PLSR predictions of chlorophyll, carotenoids, water content, and leaf mass per area transfer beyond their training conditions. Prediction accuracy declined for new locations (R² = 0.12–0.49), seasons (0.15–0.42), and plant functional types (0.25–0.56). Random cross-validation therefore gave an overly optimistic picture of performance in new domains. Training samples with greater spectral diversity improved transferability, supporting more representative sampling and explicit out-of-domain validation for large-scale trait mapping.": "本研究利用47,393条叶片光谱记录，覆盖700余个物种、八类植物功能型和101个站点，检验 PLSR 对叶绿素、类胡萝卜素、含水量及单位面积叶片质量的预测能否推广到训练条件之外。在新地点（R²=0.12—0.49）、新季节（0.15—0.42）及新植物功能型（0.25—0.56）中，预测精度下降。因此，随机交叉验证会高估模型在新的数据域中的表现。提高训练样本的光谱多样性可改善可迁移性，支持在大尺度性状制图中采用更具代表性的采样和明确的域外验证。",
  "A modified CASA–WOFOST framework combined Sentinel-2 time series with crop growth modeling to estimate field-scale wheat yield at two adjacent farms in China. CASA, the coupled model, and WOFOST achieved R² values of 0.64, 0.84, and 0.86, respectively, with RMSE of 948.32, 792.11, and 623.64 kg ha⁻¹. The coupled model improved on CASA, particularly under uneven terrain, while retaining accuracy close to WOFOST at much lower computational cost. Processing one wheat season took 48 minutes for the coupled model, compared with 37 minutes for CASA and more than a day for WOFOST.": "改进的 CASA–WOFOST 框架结合 Sentinel-2 时间序列与作物生长模拟，在中国两个相邻农场估算田块尺度小麦产量。CASA、耦合模型与 WOFOST 的 R² 分别为0.64、0.84和0.86，RMSE 分别为948.32、792.11和623.64 kg ha⁻¹。耦合模型优于 CASA，尤其在地形不平坦的条件下，同时以低得多的计算成本保持接近 WOFOST 的精度。模拟一个小麦生长季，耦合模型耗时48分钟，CASA 为37分钟，WOFOST 超过一天。",
  "In Chinese with English Abstract": "中文论文，附英文摘要",
  "At Shuangshan Farm in Heilongjiang, China, this study combined the CASA light-use-efficiency model with dry-matter partitioning from WOFOST to estimate field-scale soybean yield. HJ-1A/B satellite images spanning the growing season were used to reconstruct a daily NDVI time series for continuous crop monitoring. Compared with CASA alone, the coupled framework improved agreement with measured yields, increasing R² from 0.66853 to 0.84472. By replacing a fixed harvest index with mechanistic crop growth and allocation processes, the approach retained the computational efficiency of CASA while improving the accuracy and reliability of yield estimation for precision agriculture.": "本研究在黑龙江双山农场，将 CASA 光能利用率模型与 WOFOST 的干物质分配过程相结合，估算田块尺度大豆产量。利用覆盖生长季的 HJ-1A/B 卫星影像，重建逐日 NDVI 时间序列，以连续监测作物。相比单独使用 CASA，耦合框架与实测产量的一致性更高，R² 从0.66853提高到0.84472。通过以机理性的作物生长和分配过程替代固定收获指数，该方法保留了 CASA 的计算效率，同时提高了精准农业产量估算的精度与可靠性。",
  "Co-Author": "共同作者",
  "Forest-edge mapping tutorial": "森林边缘制图教程",
  "Seventy percent of global forests lie within 1 km of an edge, yet their temporal dynamics remain poorly characterized. By developing high spatial-resolution (0.00025°) global forest edge maps for 2000–2020, this study finds a 24 million km (7%) decline in edge length. During 2015–2020, edge length falls while forest area slightly grows, driven by patch merging in temperate and boreal regions and by tropical fragmentation; in contrast, countries such as Laos, Liberia, India, and China gain edges from new forest patches. These episodic changes closely track policy-driven land management, including logging bans, agricultural expansion, and reforestation. Given the critical role of forest edges in biodiversity and microclimate regulation, the results highlight contrasting biome patterns and the need for adaptive policies balancing conservation, carbon storage, and land use.": "全球70%的森林距边缘不足1公里，但森林边缘的时间动态尚缺乏充分认识。本研究开发了2000—2020年高空间分辨率（0.00025°）全球森林边缘图，发现边缘总长度减少2400万公里（7%）。2015—2020年，森林面积略有增加而边缘长度下降，其驱动包括温带与北方地区的斑块合并，以及热带地区的森林破碎化；相比之下，老挝、利比里亚、印度和中国等国家因新森林斑块形成而增加边缘。这些阶段性变化与禁伐、农业扩张和造林等政策驱动的土地管理密切相关。鉴于森林边缘对生物多样性与微气候调节的重要作用，结果凸显不同生物群系的差异，以及在保护、碳储存和土地利用之间寻求平衡的适应性政策需求。",
  "Biological soil crusts—photosynthetic communities of cyanobacteria, lichens, and mosses living on soil surfaces—cover roughly 12% of the global land surface, yet their role in climate mitigation remains uncertain. This study integrated multiscale remote sensing observations within a two-decade climate manipulation experiment in Castle Valley, Utah. Sustained warming and altered monsoonal rainfall drove a major shift in biocrust community composition, including a ~27% decrease in the fractional cover of late-successional mosses and a ~36% increase in early-successional, lightly-pigmented cyanobacteria. For every 10% increase in the relative cover of lightly-pigmented cyanobacteria, the authors observed a ~6.3% reduction in photosynthetic potential, a ~14.1% increase in surface brightness, a ~15.2% decrease in surface moisture, and a ~0.3 °C increase in clear-sky daytime surface temperature. These results provide experimental evidence of a biocrust degradation climate warming amplification feedback that is currently missing from process-based models, suggesting current projections may underestimate the rate of warming across global drylands.": "生物土壤结皮是由蓝藻、地衣和苔藓组成的地表光合群落，覆盖约12%的全球陆地表面，但其缓解气候变化的作用尚不明确。本研究在美国犹他州 Castle Valley 持续二十年的气候操控实验中整合多尺度遥感观测。持续增温和季风降水改变导致结皮群落组成明显转变：晚演替苔藓覆盖度减少约27%，早演替浅色蓝藻增加约36%。浅色蓝藻相对覆盖度每增加10%，光合潜力下降约6.3%，地表亮度增加约14.1%，地表水分下降约15.2%，晴空白天地表温度增加约0.3°C。这为“生物结皮退化放大气候变暖”的反馈提供了实验证据。现有过程模型尚未纳入该反馈，因此可能低估全球干旱区的变暖速度。",
  "This study examined how viewing geometry affects the relationship between gross primary productivity and NIRvP, the product of near-infrared vegetation reflectance and photosynthetically active radiation. DSCOVR/EPIC observations enabled comparison of near-hotspot geometry, where viewing and illumination directions align, with nadir geometry. Hotspot-based NIRvP tracked productivity variations more closely across ecosystems from diurnal to daily scales. MODIS observations and SCOPE model simulations supported the result. The findings point to sun-tracking observation geometries as a useful way to improve satellite monitoring of terrestrial photosynthesis.": "本研究考察观测几何如何影响总初级生产力与 NIRvP 的关系；NIRvP 是近红外植被反射率与光合有效辐射的乘积。利用 DSCOVR/EPIC 观测，比较观测与照明方向接近重合的热点几何和天底几何。热点方向的 NIRvP 在不同生态系统中，从日内到逐日尺度均更紧密地追踪生产力变化，MODIS 观测与 SCOPE 模型模拟也支持这一结果。研究表明，跟随太阳方向的观测几何有助于改进陆地光合作用的卫星监测。",
  "A hybrid machine learning model combined fuel availability, fuel flammability, and human suppression to predict large fires in the western United States. Its F1 score was 0.846 ± 0.012, outperforming process-based fire danger indices and four other machine learning models by up to 40% and 9%, respectively. Explainable analysis revealed differences in model structure even when predictive accuracy was similar. Compound influences involving evaporative demand, energy release component, temperature, and wind speed were central to fire dynamics. The study supports evaluating physical consistency alongside prediction accuracy when projecting wildfire risk.": "混合机器学习模型将可燃物可利用性、可燃性和人为抑制相结合，预测美国西部大型火灾。其 F1 分数为0.846±0.012，相比基于过程的火险指数和其他四种机器学习模型，性能最多分别提高40%和9%。可解释性分析表明，即使预测精度相近，模型结构也可能不同。蒸发需求、能量释放分量、温度与风速的复合影响对火灾动态至关重要。研究支持在预测野火风险时，同时评估物理一致性与预测精度。",
  "Media 1": "媒体报道1",
  "Free version": "免费版本",
  "Vegetation indices can show higher greenness in the US Corn Belt than in the Amazon despite the Amazon's greater leaf area. This study traced the discrepancy to canopy structure: complex forests cast more shadows than relatively uniform crops, reducing observed greenness when the viewing direction differs from solar illumination. Converting Amazon forest to cropland could consequently increase vegetation indices while decreasing leaf area. The results show why changes in greenness, and their relationship with solar-induced fluorescence, require attention to structural and viewing-angle effects when interpreting global vegetation trends.": "尽管亚马孙的叶面积更大，植被指数却可能显示美国玉米带比亚马孙更“绿”。本研究将这一差异归因于冠层结构：复杂森林比相对均一的作物冠层产生更多阴影，在观测方向偏离太阳照明方向时降低观测到的绿度。因此，将亚马孙森林转为农田，可能在减少叶面积的同时提高植被指数。结果表明，解读全球植被变化趋势时，应考虑结构和观测角度对绿度及其与太阳诱导叶绿素荧光关系的影响。",
  "An encoder–decoder fully convolutional network combined visible-band UAV imagery with the visible-band difference vegetation index to classify crops in Chengdu, China. The study distinguished maize, rice, balsam pear, and Loropetalum chinense using low-cost imagery. Its design reduced model parameters and computational cost while supporting crop classification without additional multispectral sensors. The results demonstrate the potential of visible imagery and semantic segmentation for practical agricultural mapping.": "本研究将编码器—解码器全卷积网络、无人机可见光影像和可见光波段差异植被指数相结合，在中国成都开展作物分类。利用低成本影像区分玉米、水稻、苦瓜和红花檵木。该设计减少了模型参数和计算成本，无需额外多光谱传感器即可完成分类，展示了可见光影像与语义分割在农业制图中的实用潜力。",
  "A stacked denoising autoencoder learned spectral representations from unlabeled hyperspectral pixels corrupted with random noise. Layer-wise pretraining used L-BFGS optimization, followed by supervised fine-tuning with a Softmax classifier. Tests on HySpex imagery compared the approach with PCA, SVM, PCA–SVM, and MNF–SVM. The autoencoder produced more effective features for classification, showing how unsupervised representation learning can support hyperspectral image analysis when labeled samples are limited.": "堆叠去噪自编码器利用加入随机噪声的无标签高光谱像元学习光谱表征。逐层预训练采用 L-BFGS 优化，随后结合 Softmax 分类器进行监督微调。在 HySpex 影像上的测试，与 PCA、SVM、PCA–SVM 和 MNF–SVM 相比较，自编码器提取的特征更有利于分类，表明无监督表征学习能够在标注样本有限时支持高光谱影像分析。",
  "To avoid spectral saturation during late maize growth, this study estimated late-season aboveground biomass by assimilating early-season UAV observations into WOFOST with an ensemble Kalman filter, then continuing the crop simulation without late-season image assimilation. Multispectral imagery also supplied spatial information on available soil nutrients to parameterize the model. Against field measurements, the proposed approach achieved R² = 0.86 and RMSE = 2216.79 kg ha⁻¹, compared with R² = 0.45 and RMSE = 4254.30 kg ha⁻¹ for assimilation throughout the growing season. This illustrates how early observations can support biomass estimates after optical signals become less sensitive to crop growth.": "为避免玉米生长后期的光谱饱和，本研究以集合卡尔曼滤波将生长早期的无人机观测同化到 WOFOST，再继续模拟作物生长，不同化后期影像，以估算后期地上生物量。多光谱影像还提供了土壤可利用养分的空间信息，用于模型参数化。与实测数据比较，该方法的 R²=0.86、RMSE=2216.79 kg ha⁻¹；全生长季同化方法则为 R²=0.45、RMSE=4254.30 kg ha⁻¹。这说明早期观测可在光学信号对作物生长敏感性降低后，继续支持生物量估算。",
  "This study compared ANN, SVR, Gaussian process regression, random forest, and gradient-boosted regression trees for cotton leaf area index retrieval from Sentinel-2 bands over three growing seasons in northwestern China. Gradient boosting provided the highest overall accuracy, with an average R² of 0.854, while SVR trained fastest. Experiments varying training sample sizes and the number of input bands showed different sensitivities among the models. Gradient boosting performed best on average across the sample-size tests, and ANN achieved the highest average accuracy across band-reduction tests. The results inform model selection under different data and computing constraints.": "本研究比较人工神经网络（ANN）、支持向量回归（SVR）、高斯过程回归、随机森林和梯度提升回归树，利用中国西北地区三个生长季的 Sentinel-2 波段反演棉花叶面积指数。梯度提升总体精度最高，平均 R²=0.854；SVR 训练最快。改变训练样本量和输入波段数的实验表明，各模型具有不同敏感性。在样本量测试中，梯度提升平均表现最佳；在减少波段的测试中，ANN 平均精度最高。结果可指导不同数据与计算条件下的模型选择。",
  "No matching articles. Try another keyword, research topic, or author role.": "没有匹配的论文，请尝试其他关键词、研究主题或作者类别。",
  "Under review & in preparation": "审稿中与准备中的论文",
  "manuscripts": "篇稿件",
  "Current manuscripts, with study summaries and submission status shown for each.": "当前稿件：每篇均列出研究简介和投稿状态。",
  "Manuscript under review. This study evaluates nine deep learning fusion models that reconstruct 5 m high-resolution hyperspectral imagery (HR-HSI) by combining PlanetScope multispectral imagery with NASA EMIT hyperspectral observations at 60 m, and assesses their effectiveness for estimating 13 plant functional traits. Benchmarked against independent AVIRIS-NG trait maps from the NASA SHIFT campaign in California, fused HR-HSI substantially improved trait estimation over the coarse-resolution inputs, while revealing a systematic trade-off between spectral fidelity and spatial detail that governs the operational readiness of fusion products for quantitative trait mapping.": "稿件审稿中。本研究评估九种深度学习融合模型，将 PlanetScope 多光谱影像与60米 NASA EMIT 高光谱观测结合，重建5米高空间分辨率高光谱影像（HR-HSI），并评估其估算13项植物功能性状的能力。以 NASA SHIFT 加利福尼亚观测任务的独立 AVIRIS-NG 性状图为基准，融合 HR-HSI 相比粗分辨率输入显著改善了性状估算，同时揭示了光谱保真度与空间细节之间的系统性权衡。这一权衡决定融合产品能否用于定量性状制图。",
  "Manuscript under review. This study estimates the fractional cover of all major biocrust functional types from mixed hyperspectral pixels using spectral unmixing and deep learning, with visible-range pigment absorption bands as the dominant predictors alongside red-edge and shortwave infrared contributions. Model-estimated cover reproduced the successional regression observed in a long-term climate manipulation experiment: under combined warming and altered precipitation, measured late-successional cover declined by 37.3 ± 19.2% and early-successional cover rose by 36.3 ± 10.9%, with model estimates of −20.3 ± 7.9% and +31.5 ± 7.3%. The framework offers a pathway for scaling biocrust monitoring from field plots to landscapes with current and emerging hyperspectral missions.": "稿件审稿中。本研究利用光谱解混和深度学习，从混合高光谱像元估算主要生物结皮功能类型的覆盖度。可见光色素吸收波段是主要预测变量，红边和短波红外波段也有贡献。模型估算重现了长期气候操控实验中的演替退化：增温与降水改变共同作用时，实测晚演替覆盖度下降37.3±19.2%，早演替覆盖度增加36.3±10.9%；模型估算分别为下降20.3±7.9%和增加31.5±7.3%。该框架为借助现有与新一代高光谱任务，将结皮监测从样地扩展到景观尺度提供了路径。",
  "Under Review — Science": "审稿中 — Science",
  "Manuscript under review. This study uses long-term satellite observations to document the expansion of vegetation greenness across Antarctica, characterizing where and how rapidly photosynthetic cover is increasing on the continent and linking the observed trends to climate drivers.": "稿件审稿中。本研究利用长期卫星观测记录南极洲植被绿度的扩张，刻画光合覆盖增加的位置与速度，并将这些变化趋势与气候驱动因素联系起来。",
  "Manuscript under review. This study presents a framework for generating 10 m canopy height maps by fusing Earth embeddings, Sentinel-1/2 composites, topography, and cross-sensor LiDAR observations. Spaceborne LiDAR provides globally consistent but spatially sparse samples, while airborne LiDAR offers fine-resolution measurements over limited areas; a factorial design comparing model classes and input configurations quantifies how each data source contributes to large-area canopy height mapping.": "稿件审稿中。本研究融合地球嵌入特征、Sentinel-1/2 合成影像、地形与跨传感器激光雷达观测，构建10米冠层高度制图框架。星载激光雷达提供全球一致但空间稀疏的样本，机载激光雷达则提供有限区域的精细测量。通过比较模型类别和输入配置的析因设计，量化不同数据源对大范围冠层高度制图的贡献。",
  "Manuscript under review. This study develops a constituent-based framework for mapping biological soil crusts from diagnostic spectral responses of photosynthetic and protective pigments, soil organic matter, and cellulose, rather than from surface brightness or greenness alone. Spectral measurements from eight dryland regions worldwide were analyzed with PLS regression and PLS discriminant analysis, identifying five consistent spectral regions centered near 361, 462, 689, 902, and 2056 nm. These were combined into five constituent-related indices and applied to EnMAP and EMIT hyperspectral imagery.": "稿件审稿中。本研究基于光合与保护性色素、土壤有机质和纤维素的诊断性光谱响应，开发以组成成分为基础的生物土壤结皮制图框架，而非仅依赖地表亮度或绿度。利用 PLS 回归与 PLS 判别分析，分析全球八个干旱区的光谱测量，识别出中心波长约为361、462、689、902和2056 nm的五个一致光谱区域。将其组合为五个与组成成分相关的指数，并应用到 EnMAP 与 EMIT 高光谱影像。",
  "Manuscript under review. Using a full-range (350–2500 nm) reflectance spectroscopy library of over 700 samples spanning both wet and dry status, this study develops a hierarchical classification scheme that separates biocrusts from bare soil and further resolves successional stages—lightly-pigmented cyanobacteria, darkly-pigmented cyanobacteria, nitrogen-fixing lichen, non-nitrogen-fixing lichen, and moss. The work evaluates model skill across the full successional sequence under both moisture states and identifies the wavelength regions of greatest importance, advancing large-scale successional mapping with narrow-bandwidth spaceborne imaging spectroscopy.": "稿件审稿中。本研究使用包含700余个样本、覆盖干湿状态的全波段（350—2500 nm）反射光谱库，建立分层分类方案：先区分生物结皮与裸土，再识别浅色蓝藻、深色蓝藻、固氮地衣、非固氮地衣和苔藓等演替阶段。研究评估模型在两种水分状态及完整演替序列中的表现，并识别最重要的波长区域，为利用窄波段星载成像光谱开展大尺度演替制图提供支持。",
  "In Preparation": "准备中",
  "Manuscript in preparation. Biological soil crusts cover roughly 12% of Earth’s terrestrial surface and act as ecosystem engineers of the world’s drylands, yet they remain effectively invisible to the satellite records and Earth system models used to monitor the land surface. This perspective argues that a new generation of hyperspectral imaging spectrometers can resolve diagnostic signals of pigments, hydration, organic matter, and mineral substrates across the visible-to-shortwave-infrared spectrum. Combined with spectral–spatial fusion, machine learning upscaling, and a coordinated global ground network (CrustNet), these measurements could support estimates of biocrust fractional cover, composition, and condition, and extend biocrust remote sensing from static mapping toward monitoring degradation, recovery, and climate-driven community change.": "稿件准备中。生物土壤结皮覆盖约12%的地球陆地表面，是干旱区的“生态系统工程师”，但在用于监测陆地表面的卫星记录和地球系统模型中几乎不可见。这篇观点文章认为，新一代高光谱成像光谱仪可在可见光至短波红外范围内识别色素、含水状态、有机质及矿物基底的诊断信号。结合空间—光谱融合、机器学习尺度扩展及协同全球地面网络（CrustNet），这些观测有望估算结皮覆盖度、组成和状态，将结皮遥感从静态制图推进到退化、恢复与气候驱动群落变化的动态监测。",
  "Manuscript in preparation. Using NASA’s EMIT spaceborne imaging spectrometer, this study analyzes 49 hyperspectral indices representing ten canopy functional groups across 2,371 peak-growing-season scenes worldwide, covering roughly 1.35 billion forest pixels. Distance from a forest edge structures canopy function along a coherent global syndrome: canopies are drier, more stressed, more structurally and chemically defended, and more spectrally heterogeneous near edges, but greener, wetter, more chlorophyll-rich, and more productive toward interiors. Edge influence is depth-ordered—canopy water and spectral heterogeneity recover within hundreds of meters to about a kilometer, while structural, photoprotective, and defensive chemical signals persist for several kilometers.": "稿件准备中。本研究利用 NASA EMIT 星载成像光谱仪，分析全球2,371景旺盛生长季影像，覆盖约13.5亿个森林像元，计算49个高光谱指数，分别对应十类冠层功能属性。距森林边缘的距离塑造了全球一致的冠层功能综合变化：靠近边缘的冠层更干燥、胁迫更强、结构与化学防御更明显、光谱异质性更高；向森林内部则更绿、更湿润、叶绿素更丰富、生产力更高。边缘影响具有不同作用深度：冠层水分和光谱异质性在数百米至约1公里内恢复，而结构、光保护及化学防御信号可延伸数公里。",
